{"uid":"fe27bcd411ca613d","name":"test_search_index_body_preserves_literal_angle_bracket_placeholders","fullName":"tests.test_docs_generation_contract#test_search_index_body_preserves_literal_angle_bracket_placeholders","historyId":"1ad9fb61e4a7c84026834f6aef2d0c27","time":{"start":1789826288488,"stop":1789826288647,"duration":159},"description":"A doubly-HTML-escaped placeholder must not decode to a raw HTML-like token.\n\n    ``plainTextFromHtml`` in ``build-docs.mjs`` strips markup, then decodes HTML\n    entities. Decoding ``&amp;`` before ``&lt;``/``&gt;`` used to double-unescape a\n    source string like ``&amp;lt;skill_id&amp;gt;`` (literal text meaning\n    ``&lt;skill_id&gt;``) all the way down to a bare ``<skill_id>`` — silently\n    turning escaped placeholder text into something that reads as an HTML tag.\n    A separately, correctly single-escaped ``&lt;skill_id&gt;`` elsewhere on the\n    same page must still decode to the literal ``<skill_id>`` it represents, so\n    this only pins the specific double-escaped occurrence.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A doubly-HTML-escaped placeholder must not decode to a raw HTML-like token.</p>\n<pre><code>``plainTextFromHtml`` in ``build-docs.mjs`` strips markup, then decodes HTML\nentities. Decoding ``&amp;amp;`` before ``&amp;lt;``/``&amp;gt;`` used to double-unescape a\nsource string like ``&amp;amp;lt;skill_id&amp;amp;gt;`` (literal text meaning\n``&amp;lt;skill_id&amp;gt;``) all the way down to a bare ``&lt;skill_id&gt;`` — silently\nturning escaped placeholder text into something that reads as an HTML tag.\nA separately, correctly single-escaped ``&amp;lt;skill_id&amp;gt;`` elsewhere on the\nsame page must still decode to the literal ``&lt;skill_id&gt;`` it represents, so\nthis only pins the specific double-escaped occurrence.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_po